{"id":"n1-053","title":"Noun なり Noun なり (A nari B nari)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Lists alternatives of the same kind; 'either A or B', 'A or B, for example'.","longExplanation":"The pattern AなりBなり is used to suggest alternatives or options, usually of the same category. It can be translated as 'whether A or B' or 'A or B, for example'.","formation":"Noun + なり + Noun + なり","examples":[{"jp":"映画なり、音楽なり、何か趣味はありますか。","romaji":"Eiga nari, ongaku nari, nanika shumi wa arimasu ka?","en":"Do you have any hobbies, such as movies or music?","words":[{"surface":"映画","vocabId":"1173720","reading":"えいが"},{"surface":"なり","vocabId":"1899440","reading":"なり","baseForm":"なる"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"音楽","vocabId":"1183720","reading":"おんがく"},{"surface":"なり","vocabId":"1899440","reading":"なり","baseForm":"なる"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"何","vocabId":"1577100","reading":"なに"},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"趣味","vocabId":"1329000","reading":"しゅみ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あり","vocabId":"1225940","reading":"あり","baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,4]},{"jp":"紅茶なり、コーヒーなり、何か飲み物をください。","romaji":"Koucha nari, koohii nari, nanika nomimono o kudasai.","en":"Please give me something to drink, like tea or coffee.","words":[{"surface":"紅茶","vocabId":"1280770","reading":"こうちゃ"},{"surface":"なり","vocabId":"1899440","reading":"なり","baseForm":"なる"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"コーヒー","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なり","vocabId":"1899440","reading":"なり","baseForm":"なる"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"何","vocabId":"1577100","reading":"なに"},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"飲み物","vocabId":"1600430","reading":"のみもの"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ください","vocabId":"1184270","reading":"ください","baseForm":"くださる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,4]},{"jp":"パンなり、おにぎりなり、何か食べてくださ